# Local, machine-specific artefacts of the results store. `harness/.gitignore`
# already ignores the result JSONs (`bench/results/*.json`); these two would
# otherwise show up as untracked files, and an untracked file makes every
# recording carry the `git_dirty` warning for no reason.
#
#   .thermal-sample.tsv — the pre-run thermal/load trace (record.sh --thermal-sample)
#   .record.*           — the recorder's temp file, only left behind by a crash
.thermal-sample.tsv
.record.*
